---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
const explore = [
	{ href: '/#mahi', en: 'Mahi river & viaducts' },
	{ href: '/#dal', en: '45+ toor dal mills' },
	{ href: '/study', en: 'SVIT campus' },
	{ href: '/study#research', en: 'Soil & water research' },
	{ href: '/visit', en: 'Banyan, mandirs & resort' },
	{ href: '/contact', en: 'Panchayat council' },
];
const commerce = [
	{ href: '/directory', en: 'Local trade directory' },
	{ href: '/directory#dal-marts', en: 'Toor dal retail & mills' },
	{ href: '/directory#boys-pg', en: 'Boys’ PGs & hostels' },
	{ href: '/directory#girls-pg', en: 'Girls’ PGs & hostels' },
	{ href: '/directory#mess', en: 'Mess & tiffin services' },
	{ href: '/directory#getlisted', en: 'Feature your business' },
];
---

<footer class="mt-20 bg-ink text-cream">
	<div class="chain" aria-hidden="true"></div>
	<div class="wrap pt-10 pb-8">
		<p class="font-gu mb-9 text-2xl font-bold text-mustard" aria-hidden="true">
			હોર્ન ઓકે પ્લીઝ <span class="font-display ml-2 text-[1.15rem] font-normal tracking-[0.08em] text-cream">Horn OK Please</span>
		</p>
		<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-14 gap-y-10">
			<div class="flex min-w-48 max-w-96 flex-col gap-1.5">
				<p class="mb-1 font-display text-xl text-mustard">Vasad · <span class="font-gu">વસુધાનગરી</span></p>
				<p class="max-w-[34ch] text-[0.95rem] text-cream/85">
					The historic gateway to Charotar on the northern bank of the Mahi — 45+ toor dal
					mills, the SVIT campus, the 200-year banyan, and the ICAR soil &amp; water station.
				</p>
				<p class="text-[0.9rem] font-semibold tracking-[0.03em] text-cream/85">22.45°N · 73.0667°E · 18.89 m MSL</p>
				<p class="text-[0.9rem] font-semibold tracking-[0.03em] text-cream/85">PIN 388306 · STD 02692 · NH 48 · Station VDA</p>
			</div>
			<nav class="flex min-w-48 flex-col gap-1.5" aria-label="Explore">
				<p class="mb-1 font-display text-xl text-mustard">Explore</p>
				{explore.map((l) => <a class="w-fit text-[0.95rem] text-cream hover:text-mustard" href={l.href}>{l.en}</a>)}
			</nav>
			<nav class="flex min-w-48 flex-col gap-1.5" aria-label="Commerce and living">
				<p class="mb-1 font-display text-xl text-mustard">Commerce &amp; living</p>
				{commerce.map((l) => <a class="w-fit text-[0.95rem] text-cream hover:text-mustard" href={l.href}>{l.en}</a>)}
			</nav>
			<div class="flex min-w-48 flex-col gap-1.5">
				<p class="mb-1 font-display text-xl text-mustard">The corridor</p>
				<p class="text-[0.9rem] font-semibold tracking-[0.03em] text-cream/85">Anand 15 km</p>
				<p class="text-[0.9rem] font-semibold tracking-[0.03em] text-cream/85">Vadodara 20 km</p>
				<p class="text-[0.9rem] font-semibold tracking-[0.03em] text-cream/85">Ahmedabad 75 km</p>
				<p class="text-[0.9rem] font-semibold tracking-[0.03em] text-cream/85">Mumbai 420 km</p>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="mt-10 rounded-xl border-[2.5px] border-cream/35 px-6 py-5">
			<p class="font-display text-[1.05rem] text-mustard">Community notice · unofficial portal</p>
			<p class="mt-2 text-[0.92rem] text-cream/85">
				An independent community project documenting the heritage, industry and civic life of
				Vasad — under active development, and not the municipal government website. For
				official panchayat matters, call the Panchayat Bhavan directly at {' '}
				<a class="whitespace-nowrap text-mustard hover:text-cream" href="tel:+912692274220">02692 274220</a>. Found an inaccuracy, or know a story the
				boards should carry? Write to {' '}
				<a class="text-mustard hover:text-cream" href="mailto:jainilprajapati9@gmail.com">jainilprajapati9@gmail.com</a>. Code lives {' '}
				at <a class="text-mustard hover:text-cream" href="https://github.com/jaainil/vasad.in">github.com/jaainil/vasad.in</a>.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-2 text-[0.9rem]">
				Developed by <a class="text-mustard hover:text-cream" href="https://jaainil.com">Jainil Prajapati</a>
			</p>
		</div>
		<p class="mt-8 text-[0.85rem] text-cream/60">© {year} Vasad (Vasudhanagari) · an unofficial community project by Jainil Prajapati.</p>
	</div>
</footer>
